OL,3,AUS launches more strikes on Iran as
OL,4,Astate media reports explosions
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe IRGC said the US would regret the
OL,7,Fstrikes, as US President Donald Trump
OL,8,Fwarned that Iran would be hit again at
OL,9,F"a much harder and higher level" if it
OL,10,Fretaliated.
